cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this replication package, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "ADMA: weak-link penalisation in agri-food digital maturity assessment (replication package)"
abstract: >-
  Replication package for the paper "Benchmarking agri-food digital maturity without masking the weak link":
  original Eurostat and Derzhstat data for food processing (NACE C10-C12), scripts that reproduce every number
  of the paper, and an Excel workbook with hand-checkable calculations. Documentation, workbook and results
  in English and Ukrainian.
